    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic nonogram game, which has been expanding the brains of logic puzzle players for over 15 years, is finally making its way to Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelogic is a challenging and fun pixel logic game where you use numeric clues to uncover a hidden picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Two new puzzles each day + a larger weekly puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Unlimited access to back catalog of 6,000+ past daily puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Choose your challenge from Easy to Expert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Know where you rank with worldwide statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Create and share your own puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Dark Mode and many customization options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Optimized to play with mouse &amp; keyboard or gamepad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the logic game originating from Japan also known as Picross, Nonograms, Paint-by-numbers and Griddlers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classic nonogram game, which has been expanding the brains of logic puzzle players for over 15 years, is finally making its way to Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelogic is a challenging and fun pixel logic game where you use numeric clues to uncover a hidden picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Two new puzzles each day + a larger weekly puzzle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Unlimited access to back catalog of 6,000+ past daily puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Choose your challenge from Easy to Expert</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Know where you rank with worldwide statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Create and share your own puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Dark Mode and many customization options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25a0 Optimized to play with mouse &amp; keyboard or gamepad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the logic game originating from Japan also known as Picross, Nonograms, Paint-by-numbers and Griddlers.</p>",
    "short_description": "Like a mixture between Sudoku and Minesweeper, use numeric clues to reveal a hidden pixel art picture. With an included puzzle creator, new human-crafted nonogram puzzles every day, and a back catalog of 6,000+ puzzles, you'll have challenging and fun puzzles to play every day!",
